    "title": "pandas.PeriodIndex.quarter — pandas 3.1.0.dev0 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.PeriodIndex.quarter#\n\n- property PeriodIndex.quarter[source]#\n- The quarter of the date. Returns the quarter (1 through 4) for each period in the index. See also \n  - `PeriodIndex.qyear`\n  - Fiscal year the Period lies in according to its starting-quarter.\n Examples >>> idx = pd.PeriodIndex([\"2023-01\", \"2023-02\", \"2023-03\"], freq=\"M\") >>> idx.quarter Index([1, 1, 1], dtype='int64')",
